observe_tool_call now has ten rows, configured through observeOnVolume first —
6a37998 left the entry out and said so in that helper's doc comment, and this is
the commit that reads it. observe_session has no binder, so the transport
answers  and no entry could pass; the loop now skips what does not
ship, the same rule the count assertion applies to a deferred cell, and #207
removes the skip by binding the tool.

